# Deliberately NOT elevated, and it must stay that way. cmdkey is PER-USER, so
# running this as an admin account would show the technician's own vault while
# the staff user's entries - the ones actually breaking their access - stayed
# invisible. Run it as whoever is having the problem. Show-CredentialIdentity
